			<div class="textContent" ><p><strong style="font-size: 0.95em;">NEW VOTING LOCATIONS EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY (2026 ELECTIONS)</strong><span style="font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;; font-size: 0.95em;">:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-style: normal; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;; font-size: 0.95em;"><strong>Precincts 1, 2, 3, 5 &amp; 6 are now</strong></span><span style="font-style: normal; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;; font-size: 0.95em;"><strong> back at the Middle School Gymnasium, 151 Pauline Street.&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style="font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;; font-size: 0.95em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;">Precinct 4 remains at O'Connell Hall on Golden Drive.  Polls are open from 7 a.m. to 8 p.m.</span></p></div>
